# Wave T38 (Driftlog kit): raftroof — RAFT-TIMBER SHINGLE: warm-brown timber shingle courses, staggered shakes, a log ridge read in the lit tops, one coral-trim fleck at the eave (the style table's coral carried to the roof edge). Unlike Ashfall's weatherboard timberroof, Eldergrove's thatch and Steamspring's clay barrel. Worn by Driftlog's three facade boat-houses. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T38-DRIFTLOG-PLAN.md §5.)
